# The ghost save prompt for every profile (game.ghost_prompt on, docs/port/SAVES.md "The ghost save prompt"): as
# ghost.press, but the profile's third letter is one to the right of N (one LEFT, not two), so its name is not the
# cartridge's developer name (cheat_profile_name) and LoadPlayerData leaves the prompt's flag (gSaveGhostFiles) clear, as for any
# player. The ghost race (gRace 2, track 0 backward) ends 35.6 s in; paused and quit, the results: updateHighScoreScreen
# opens the save prompt because of the setting, whose save item writes the ghost (SaveGhost) to the pak; then the
# game over screen. The checks: the pak's two notes, the profile and its ghost (ghost_off.press: none without it).
# until: 0x800000:60
# seconds: 120
# args: --pak ghost_prompt.mpk --set game.ghost_prompt=on
# expect: state=0x00800000: players 1, windows 1, cars 1, mode 2, track 0
# visits: 0x2000000
# check: tools/port/pak_notes.py ghost_prompt.mpk --notes 2 --note SYNTH049SYO.D --ghost SYNTH049SYO1R.T:0:1
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt
11 A           # the main menu: the race; the player screen
14 DOWN 0.1    # the pak row
14.5 DOWN 0.1  # create a player
15 A           # the name entry: S Y N, END (as profile.press)
15.5 DOWN 0.1
16 DOWN 0.1
16.5 A
17 RIGHT 0.1
17.3 RIGHT 0.1
17.6 RIGHT 0.1
17.9 RIGHT 0.1
18.2 RIGHT 0.1
18.5 RIGHT 0.1
19 A
19.5 UP 0.1
20 LEFT 0.1
21 A
22 START       # CreatePlayer; the cursor on SYN
23 UP 0.1      # the pak row
23.5 UP 0.1    # the default player
24 A           # ready: SYN, not picked, is purged; the mode screen
27 B           # back to the player screen
30 DOWN 0.1    # the pak row
30.5 DOWN 0.1  # SYN
31 A           # ready: LoadPlayerData reads SYN from the pak; the mode screen
34 DOWN 0.1    # the ghost race, two modes down
34.3 DOWN 0.1
35 A
37 RIGHT 0.1   # the track select's one option, backward: on
38 A           # track 0
41 A           # the car select; the race from 44 s, the finish at 79.6 s
84 START       # pause
85 UP 0.1      # quit
86 A           # are you sure?
87 RIGHT 0.1   # yes
88 A           # the results; the save prompt from 88 s, on its pak row (pak 1: room for a ghost)
92 DOWN 0.1    # save
94 A           # SaveGhost; the message
97 A           # the records
100 A          # the game over screen
